#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1928
msgid ""
"This file format is not very widespread and therefore support by 3rd-party "
"applications is limited."
msgstr ""
"Formatet är inte särskilt spritt och stödet i tredjepartsprogram är därför "
"begränsat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1940
msgid "Microsoft Excel Office Open XML SpreadsheetML"
msgstr "Microsoft Excel Office Open XML SpreadsheetML"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1942
msgid ""
"Microsoft Office<trademark/> 2007 shipped with a new set of file formats, "
"namely the Microsoft Office Open XML SpreadsheetML format. This format is a "
"semi-open standard based around a zipped XML file. Microsoft Office Open XML"
" SpreadsheetML is mostly standardized in ECMA 376 and ISO 29500. This "
"implementation is covered under the Open Specification Promise and therefore"
" does not infringe upon Microsoft patents."
msgstr ""
"Microsoft Office<trademark/> 2007 introducerade en ny uppsättning filformat,"
" däribland Microsoft Office Open XML SpreadsheetML. Formatet är en halvöppen"
" standard som bygger på en ZIP-fil med XML-innehåll. Microsoft Office Open "
"XML SpreadsheetML är till största delen standardiserat i ECMA 376 och ISO "
"29500. Implementationen omfattas av Open Specification Promise och gör "
"därför inte intrång i Microsofts patent."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1992 C/gnumeric.xml:2091
msgid "Most core features of the format are supported."
msgstr "De flesta grundfunktionerna i formatet stöds."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2040
msgid "Microsoft Excel XML"
msgstr "Microsoft Excel XML"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2042
msgid ""
"The Microsoft Excel<trademark/> file format is a binary file format used by "
"the <application>Excel</application> program in the "
"<application>Office</application> suite. The format is a common format "
"supported to various extents by most spreadsheets although it is "
"incompletely documented. The <application>Gnumeric</application> project has"
" reversed engineered all of the core features of the format."
msgstr ""
"Microsoft Excel<trademark/>s filformat är ett binärformat som används av "
"programmet <application>Excel</application> i paketet "
"<application>Office</application>. De flesta kalkylprogram stöder formatet i"
" någon utsträckning, även om dokumentationen är ofullständig. "
"<application>Gnumeric</application>-projektet har baklängeskonstruerat alla "
"centrala funktioner i formatet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2096
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> does not support the very old file "
"formats used by Excel<trademark/> versions prior to Excel<trademark/> 2.0."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> stöder inte de allra äldsta filformaten "
"från Excel<trademark/>-versioner före Excel<trademark/> 2.0."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2102
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> can open files from most of the "
"Microsoft Excel<trademark/> file formats and all of the recent file formats."
" The formats supported are: <_:itemizedlist-1/>"
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan öppna filer från de flesta Microsoft"
" Excel<trademark/>-formaten och alla nyare format. Format som stöds: "
"<_:itemizedlist-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2173
msgid "Multiplan SYLK File Format"
msgstr "Filformatet Multiplan SYLK"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2175
msgid ""
"The Microsoft Multiplan Symbolic Link Interchange (SYLK) file format is a "
"column based format."
msgstr ""
"Microsoft Multiplan Symbolic Link Interchange (SYLK) är ett kolumnbaserat "
"filformat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2180
msgid "<application>Gnumeric</application> can read files in this format."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan läsa filer i det här formatet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2191
msgid "Symbolic Link Interchange (SYLK)"
msgstr "Symbolic Link Interchange (SYLK)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2197
msgid "none / .slk"
msgstr "none / .slk"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2203
msgid "<application>Multiplan</application>"
msgstr "<application>Multiplan</application>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2233
msgid "Supported by the 'Multiplan (SYLK)' plugin."
msgstr "Stöds av insticksmodulen ’Multiplan (SYLK)’."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2258
msgid "OpenDocument Format (OASIS ODF and ISO/IEC 26300:2006)"
msgstr "OpenDocument-format (OASIS ODF och ISO/IEC 26300:2006)"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2260
msgid ""
"The OpenOffice.org XML file format is zip archive including several "
"components all of which are text files, most of these with markup in the "
"eXtensible Markup Language (XML)."
msgstr ""
"OpenOffice.orgs XML-filformat är ett ZIP-arkiv med flera delar, som alla "
"består av textfiler. De flesta innehåller markup i Extensible Markup "
"Language (XML)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2266
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> reads version 1.0, 1.1 and 1.2 of ODF "
"spreadsheet files and writes version 1.2 files with or without foreign "
"elements. Foreign elements are an extension mechanism defined in ODF and "
"allow features to be saved in ODF files that are not specifically "
"standardized by ODF. <application>Gnumeric</application> plans to continue "
"to support this format in the future."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan läsa version 1.0, 1.1 och 1.2 av "
"ODF-kalkylblad och skriva version 1.2, med eller utan främmande element. "
"Främmande element är en utökningsmekanism som definieras i ODF. Den gör det "
"möjligt att spara funktioner i ODF-filer som inte uttryckligen har "
"standardiserats av ODF. <application>Gnumeric</application> planerar att "
"fortsätta stödja formatet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2324 C/gnumeric.xml:2454
msgid "Supported by the 'Open Document Format' plugin."
msgstr "Stöds av insticksmodulen ’Open Document Format’."
